"Prose counts code points; JavaScript counts UTF-16 code units."
word is "😀"
print length word
print word:length
print word.1
print word:slice with 0, 2

"Prose starts at 1; JavaScript list methods start at 0."
words is "first", "second", "third"
print words.1
print words:at 0
print words:slice with 0, 2
js_position is words:index_of "second"
if js_position >= 0
    print words.(js_position + 1)

"A colon forces a property, even when a numeric variable has that name."
map is 1
print words.map
print words:map function takes item return item:to_upper_case run

"Bare property names become camelCase; quoted keys preserve their spelling."
data is JSON.parse "{\"userId\":\"converted\",\"user_id\":\"literal\"}"
print data.user_id
print data.("user_id")
